sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Client
  participant G as API Gateway / Auth
  participant O as Observation Service
  participant S as Event and State Store
  participant A as UAA Orchestrator
  participant K as GraphRAG
  participant P as Policy Engine
  actor H as Human Approver
  participant T as Tool Gateway
  C->>G: POST observation /api/v1/observations
  G->>G: Validate identity + tenant + scope + quota
  G->>O: authorized observation
  O->>S: idempotent write + provenance
  S-->>O: observation_id
  O-->>C: 202 receipt
  A->>S: retrieve authorized events / state
  A->>K: retrieve graph and source evidence (ACL filtered)
  K-->>A: citations + graph paths
  A->>P: evaluate proposed action, trust level, evidence
  alt DENY / REVIEW_REQUIRED
    P-->>A: block; append audit
  else APPROVAL_REQUIRED
    P-->>H: request human approval
    alt rejected or expired
      H-->>P: deny
      P-->>A: block
    else approved
      H-->>P: approved
      P->>T: bounded authenticated service invocation
      T-->>S: append execution outcome
    end
  else ALLOW_BOUNDED
    P->>T: authorized low-risk tool invocation
    T-->>S: append execution outcome
  end
